From 6221cd96426d2d940dda589cd95208437e833b67 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: phlink <dev@phlink.local>
Date: Thu, 30 Apr 2026 02:47:31 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] phlink: phase 10.06 settings help updater controls

Wire phlink updater state into chrome://settings/help without forking the settings page. Adds WebUI messages for reading updater status, toggling the auto-check local-state pref, and triggering a manual CheckNow path. The Check now command remains available even when automatic checks are disabled, matching the pref contract.

Register updater local-state prefs during browser pref registration and add the service factory dependency needed by AboutHandler.

Tests: autoninja -j 8 -C out/Default phlink_updater_unittests chrome; out/Default/phlink_updater_unittests; codesign --force --deep --sign - out/Default/phlink.app.

Refs phlink phase 10-06.
